  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-03-12T19:42:53.674Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Problem:\nCommunication inside vrchat can only be done where you are online, join a friend in a world and talk, there is no way to leave messages to people when they are not online, so many people tend to go outside vrchat to leave messages using platforms like discord.\nSolution:\nInternal message system, a way to communicate with other players so they get the messages when they go on. Keeping the communication going among players is key for a solid community and the growth real social friendships. Keeping it inside vrchat is better for the game and the community as a hole. As a suggestion it would be great that it can be done also from the webpage that way if you are not able to sign on because of real life you could still send a message to the people that are online.",
